+    `KD/100sh 3rd ${(100 * o.kd3).toFixed(3)} (data ${(100 * o.kdT3).toFixed(3)}) 5rd ${(100 * o.kd5).toFixed(3)} (data ${(100 * o.kdT5).toFixed(3)}) ` +
